{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.display-name",
      "text": "调试中的人"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.initial-history",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.session.sample-02-s1.title",
      "text": "报错没意见"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.user-message",
      "text": "熬夜调脚本快疯了，一直报 IndexError。我就取个列表第一个元素，语法明明没写错，怎么老跟我过不去？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.check-empty-input.label",
      "text": "确认输入是否空"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.check-empty-input.player-reply",
      "text": "你取的是第一个，先看列表里有没有元素。空列表没有第一个，所以会报这个错。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.check-empty-input.user-reply",
      "text": "啊，我还没查列表里有没有东西。先去看一下输入。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.empty-drawer-analogy.label",
      "text": "空抽屉类比"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.empty-drawer-analogy.player-reply",
      "text": "这像是伸手取抽屉第一件东西，却没确认抽屉里有没有。先查一下列表是不是空的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.empty-drawer-analogy.user-reply",
      "text": "懂了，我先看看抽屉里到底有没有东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.distinguish-syntax-runtime.label",
      "text": "区分语法与运行"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.distinguish-syntax-runtime.player-reply",
      "text": "语法可以是对的。IndexError 说的是下标超出了范围；空列表也不能取第一个。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s1/r1.choice.distinguish-syntax-runtime.user-reply",
      "text": "明白，下标也得对应得上内容。我先查列表里到底有多少东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.session.sample-02-s2.title",
      "text": "报错没意见"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.user-message",
      "text": "查了，今天确实没有数据。我本来想没数据时显示“暂无记录”，结果直接崩了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.restate-empty-input.label",
      "text": "复述空输入事实"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.restate-empty-input.player-reply",
      "text": "问题位置找到了：空列表还走了取第一个元素的流程，没走到“暂无记录”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.restate-empty-input.user-reply",
      "text": "对，破案了，总算知道为什么今晚突然报错了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.guard-before-read.label",
      "text": "先判空再取值"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.guard-before-read.player-reply",
      "text": "取值前先加一步判断，有数据才拿第一个，空的就直接走“暂无记录”分支。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.guard-before-read.user-reply",
      "text": "明白了，我先把空列表这条分支补上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.distinguish-debugging-checks.label",
      "text": "区分两种排查"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.distinguish-debugging-checks.player-reply",
      "text": "允许没有记录，就处理空列表；如果今天本该有记录，还要查数据是在哪一步没进来的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary.pool.sample-02.node.sample-02-s2/r1.choice.distinguish-debugging-checks.user-reply",
      "text": "今天没记录是正常的，那我先补空列表这条分支。"
    }
  ]
}
